1
00:00:00,541 --> 00:00:03,166
Hey guys! Let's play catch!

2
00:00:03,166 --> 00:00:03,875
Yoy!

3
00:00:05,958 --> 00:00:08,000
It's no fun without Match!

4
00:00:08,166 --> 00:00:13,958
What a horrible place. The Tiny Loser Chamber
must be for Match!

5
00:00:14,208 --> 00:00:19,125
Yeah, Ice Cube. You're a good person,
but Match is WAY BETTER!

6
00:00:19,291 --> 00:00:19,958
Wha?

7
00:00:20,083 --> 00:00:22,708
Match is way better, by a mile!

8
00:00:23,083 --> 00:00:26,583
Pencil:
Icy, compared to Match... you're garbage.

9
00:00:27,375 --> 00:00:34,083
[INTRO PLAYS]

10
00:00:34,083 --> 00:00:35,083
Subtitles: TAFFYMARZI

11
00:00:39,708 --> 00:00:42,291
Ice Cube, Leafy, Eraser and Firey.

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,416
Last episode you four had the lowest scores.

13
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,158
The voters have voted.

14
00:00:47,791 --> 00:00:50,375
Let's see which of the four of you will be eliminated.

15
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:06,458
I really hope Ice Cube doesn't get eliminated!
She doesn't deserve to.

16
00:01:06,458 --> 00:01:08,916
Yeah, yeah, blah blah, whatever.

17
00:01:08,916 --> 00:01:10,625
Hey, that was mean!

18
00:01:10,625 --> 00:01:11,625
Are you ready yet?

19
00:01:11,625 --> 00:01:13,166
Y-yeah?

20
00:01:13,166 --> 00:01:14,166
Okay, then.

21
00:01:14,791 --> 00:01:19,333
First, I'd like to point out, that
we have a large crowd watching this event today.

22
00:01:19,916 --> 00:01:22,916
So, we got 220 votes. David?

23
00:01:22,916 --> 00:01:23,583
Yeah?

24
00:01:23,583 --> 00:01:27,166
For some reason, 39 people voted exclusively for you.

25
00:01:27,166 --> 00:01:28,666
Aw, seriously?

26
00:01:28,666 --> 00:01:32,625
Voters, David was someone you
were not allowed to vote for.

27
00:01:33,166 --> 00:01:35,666
Anyway, I have ten nickels.

28
00:01:35,666 --> 00:01:37,458
No cake this time!?

29
00:01:37,570 --> 00:01:38,125
Nope.

30
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:42,500
Moving on. If you get a nickel, you are safe for this episode.

31
00:01:43,083 --> 00:01:45,000
If you don't, you will be eliminated.

32
00:01:45,166 --> 00:01:46,500
That's harsh!

33
00:01:47,083 --> 00:01:51,250
So the seven of you who did not fall
into the bottom four are safe from elimination.

34
00:01:52,208 --> 00:01:54,041
There are only three nickels remaining.

35
00:01:57,208 --> 00:02:00,958
Leafy, you only got 20 votes, so you are safe.

36
00:02:03,791 --> 00:02:04,583
Yeah!

37
00:02:04,791 --> 00:02:08,750
Firey, with a measly 29 votes, you are also safe.

38
00:02:11,666 --> 00:02:12,375
Yay!

39
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:14,000
There is only one nickel left.

40
00:02:14,583 --> 00:02:18,333
Ice Cube, Eraser, one of you will be eliminated.

41
00:02:18,666 --> 00:02:24,625
[DRUMROLL]

42
00:02:24,625 --> 00:02:27,625
[CYMBAL CRASH]

43
00:02:29,041 --> 00:02:30,875
Eraser, goodbye.

44
00:02:35,916 --> 00:02:38,666
Ice Cube, you get to stay for another day...

45
00:02:39,916 --> 00:02:40,666
...or not.

46
00:02:41,375 --> 00:02:44,375
So, now with Eraser gone, you are the final ten again.

47
00:02:44,375 --> 00:02:45,916
Everyone:
Yaaay!

48
00:02:45,916 --> 00:02:49,000
As a reward, you get another half of a pair of scissors.

49
00:02:49,083 --> 00:02:51,041
Ooh, so now I have two!

50
00:02:51,791 --> 00:02:52,916
Nice scissors, huh?

51
00:02:52,916 --> 00:02:53,791
Firey:
Yeah!

52
00:02:53,791 --> 00:02:57,708
[ERASER SIGHS]

53
00:02:57,875 --> 00:03:00,375
This screen is currently showing your scores.

54
00:03:02,250 --> 00:03:07,416
But at the end of this episode, the three people
with the lowest scores will be up for elimination.

55
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:11,083
Moving on, try to guess what's under this blanket.

56
00:03:11,250 --> 00:03:15,500
- Bonus points!
- A mini version of Dream Island!
- A previously eliminated contestant!

57
00:03:15,500 --> 00:03:15,791
- A previously eliminated contestant!
- A dead body!

58
00:03:15,791 --> 00:03:16,666
- A dead body!

59
00:03:16,666 --> 00:03:20,500
Hmm... a barf bag, and... a taco.

60
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:22,333
Hold on, Firey, you're right.

61
00:03:23,541 --> 00:03:24,375
Ooooh!

62
00:03:24,916 --> 00:03:29,625
In this episode, you each have a choice
on what contest you would like to participate in.

63
00:03:30,041 --> 00:03:31,958
You can choose between Barf Bag-

64
00:03:31,958 --> 00:03:32,958
-or Taco.

65
00:03:33,125 --> 00:03:35,416
I will choose the taco contest.

66
00:03:35,416 --> 00:03:37,666
Bubble, Ice Cube, and Pencil:
We choose the barf bag!

67
00:03:37,916 --> 00:03:41,541
Hmm... that's a tough choice. I will say taco.

68
00:03:41,541 --> 00:03:43,750
I also think that tacos are quite delicious.

69
00:03:43,875 --> 00:03:44,375
Bleh!

70
00:03:47,500 --> 00:03:48,625
Taco!

71
00:03:48,708 --> 00:03:50,500
Barf bag! Ha, ha, ha, ha!

72
00:03:50,500 --> 00:03:52,833
I choose the one with the taco.

73
00:03:53,375 --> 00:03:55,083
So now you all have chosen.

74
00:03:55,291 --> 00:03:57,541
Let's start with the barf bag contest.

75
00:03:58,083 --> 00:04:00,333
You're all floating in a large barf bag.

76
00:04:01,166 --> 00:04:04,916
For every second you stay on top of your island, you earn one point.

77
00:04:06,583 --> 00:04:07,083
Go.

78
00:04:07,083 --> 00:04:10,333
OMG! Bubble, is that actually vomit?

79
00:04:10,375 --> 00:04:11,500
No, it's colored water.

80
00:04:11,625 --> 00:04:12,125
Bleh!

81
00:04:13,166 --> 00:04:13,875
Nevermind!

82
00:04:13,958 --> 00:04:17,333
Eeeeew! This is so gross!

83
00:04:17,541 --> 00:04:20,708
OMG, Rocky, why did you have to do that!?

84
00:04:20,958 --> 00:04:22,250
Grrrr!

85
00:04:22,833 --> 00:04:23,125
Huah!

86
00:04:24,666 --> 00:04:26,708
That was mean, Pencil!

87
00:04:29,166 --> 00:04:30,791
Huh! Huuyah!

88
00:04:30,791 --> 00:04:31,791
- Ice Cube: Ahhh!
- Bubble: Oi!
- Pencil: Huah!

89
00:04:37,083 --> 00:04:38,708
OMG, a leak!

90
00:04:38,875 --> 00:04:39,500
Hueh...

91
00:04:39,916 --> 00:04:40,541
Pencil:
Yay!

92
00:04:40,541 --> 00:04:41,500
Whatever.

93
00:04:41,583 --> 00:04:42,208
Grrr!

94
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:43,000
Ehhhya!

95
00:04:44,791 --> 00:04:46,958
Bubble! Let's make ice cream!

96
00:04:46,958 --> 00:04:53,000
Cone, ice, flavoring, whipped cream!
And voila! Taste it!

97
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,041
Eleeehhh!

98
00:04:54,041 --> 00:04:57,375
[BUBBLE GRUMBLES AND CHOKES]

99
00:04:58,416 --> 00:05:02,541
Yuck! This tastes absolutely terrible! This is garbage!

100
00:05:04,666 --> 00:05:06,333
Oh no!

101
00:05:06,333 --> 00:05:12,000
Ahhhhhhh!

102
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,666
Well, that happened quickly.

103
00:05:24,375 --> 00:05:26,541
Now it's time for the Taco contest.

104
00:05:26,541 --> 00:05:30,125
Which is? See, I'm filling in for Eraser.

105
00:05:30,250 --> 00:05:31,833
Try to make a taco.

106
00:05:32,416 --> 00:05:34,333
Announcer:
You can use any ingredients you want.

107
00:05:34,750 --> 00:05:35,125
Go.

108
00:05:35,333 --> 00:05:41,125
Okay, so I'll need a tortilla, some lettuce, a tomato...

109
00:05:41,125 --> 00:05:44,041
I'm really glad I didn't choose the Taco contest.

110
00:05:44,041 --> 00:05:45,416
Huh? Why not?

111
00:05:45,416 --> 00:05:48,500
You know what? I-I don't wanna hear
any stupid questions right now.

112
00:05:49,125 --> 00:05:53,500
Hey Leafy, why are you making such a big taco?

113
00:05:53,500 --> 00:05:58,000
So if anyone is having trouble making a
taco themselves, I can lend some!

114
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:01,333
Oh, so, is it like you do it for me?

115
00:06:01,333 --> 00:06:03,000
Uhh, I guess so?

116
00:06:03,250 --> 00:06:05,958
Yeah, I got myself a servant right here!

117
00:06:05,958 --> 00:06:06,708
Grrr!

118
00:06:06,708 --> 00:06:08,791
So, how much do I gotta pay?

119
00:06:08,958 --> 00:06:10,958
TWO HUNDRED VIGINTILLION DOLLARS!

120
00:06:10,958 --> 00:06:13,541
Well, what do you know?

121
00:06:13,541 --> 00:06:16,041
Mbueh, mbueh, RUEH, RRUH, RUH!

122
00:06:16,250 --> 00:06:17,333
Huehhh...

123
00:06:18,333 --> 00:06:21,041
Aw, now I have to start all over again!

124
00:06:21,375 --> 00:06:22,458
I'm done.

125
00:06:22,458 --> 00:06:23,125
That's good.

126
00:06:23,125 --> 00:06:24,250
Me too!

127
00:06:24,250 --> 00:06:26,458
Wow! Armless people are ahead.

128
00:06:28,166 --> 00:06:29,375
Here, take it.

129
00:06:30,583 --> 00:06:32,000
Here's my taco.

130
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,291
Mine too!

131
00:06:33,416 --> 00:06:35,750
Come on, Firey. Hurry up!

132
00:06:35,916 --> 00:06:37,458
Okay, I'm done.

133
00:06:37,833 --> 00:06:42,291
Here's my taco. I-it's a bit burnt, though.

134
00:06:42,291 --> 00:06:44,291
So all five of you have finished.

135
00:06:44,666 --> 00:06:49,541
Tennis Ball, you finished first.
Let's see how good your taco is.

136
00:06:49,958 --> 00:06:52,916
The ten eliminated contestants will taste your taco.

137
00:06:53,375 --> 00:06:56,666
You'll get 10 points for each person who likes your taco.

138
00:06:58,500 --> 00:07:02,000
The results are coming in.
Let's see what they have to say.

139
00:07:04,833 --> 00:07:09,500
Tennis Ball, exactly half of the
eliminated contestants like your taco.

140
00:07:09,500 --> 00:07:11,958
I was expecting a bit more,

141
00:07:11,958 --> 00:07:17,791
considering the fact that you've been
feeding them only bread for the past 13 months.

142
00:07:18,208 --> 00:07:18,791
Whatever.

143
00:07:19,291 --> 00:07:20,513
Spongy is next.

144
00:07:23,583 --> 00:07:26,625
Woo! Good job, Spongy!

145
00:07:27,375 --> 00:07:31,250
Even though you'd used your feet to make your taco,
8 people liked it.

146
00:07:31,250 --> 00:07:32,583
Yaaay!

147
00:07:32,958 --> 00:07:35,333
Leafy, you had the largest taco.

148
00:07:37,833 --> 00:07:39,416
That's pretty good. I'll take it.

149
00:07:39,583 --> 00:07:40,750
Up next is Pen.

150
00:07:41,166 --> 00:07:46,083
To guarantee you're staying here for
one more episode, you need at least 4 likes.

151
00:07:46,083 --> 00:07:47,916
Come on, come on!

152
00:07:50,125 --> 00:07:50,875
What?!

153
00:07:51,041 --> 00:07:52,625
People can tell when you've cheated.

154
00:07:52,875 --> 00:07:54,291
Awww...

155
00:07:54,291 --> 00:07:55,458
Firey, hello.

156
00:07:55,458 --> 00:07:56,208
Hello.

157
00:07:56,250 --> 00:07:57,875
You are the last person, you know.

158
00:07:57,875 --> 00:07:58,500
Yeah.

159
00:07:58,625 --> 00:08:02,041
Bubble and Rocky are already
guaranteed to be in the danger zone.

160
00:08:02,166 --> 00:08:03,958
Either you or Pen will join them.

161
00:08:04,625 --> 00:08:09,833
Firey, to beat Pen and get out of the
danger zone, you need at least 6 likes.

162
00:08:09,833 --> 00:08:11,250
6 likes, okay.

163
00:08:11,250 --> 00:08:12,250
Let's see how you did.

164
00:08:14,708 --> 00:08:15,333
Yes!

165
00:08:15,500 --> 00:08:16,208
No!

166
00:08:16,208 --> 00:08:21,125
I guess eliminated contestants like burnt food,
you know all crispy and everything.

167
00:08:21,583 --> 00:08:25,875
So that means that Pen, Bubble and Rocky
fall into the danger zone.

168
00:08:26,458 --> 00:08:29,125
So the voting will only be between the three of them.

169
00:08:29,500 --> 00:08:34,583
People, vote off which one you think
should be eliminated from the Battle for Dream Island.

170
00:08:44,083 --> 00:08:47,500
So, I guess they aren't sending us any more tacos?